From 3dfe3a709bdde68a3b2602e407b3b9da5ab64646 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:42:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] fix(rfork): harden weight reuse and planner recovery

Add P/D model and layout switches to compatibility fingerprints, keep seed services alive across transient planner failures with background retries, and require destination registration cache for reads.

Also add bounded tensor layout diagnostics, guard session shutdown against reentrant cleanup, and limit planner exception handling to expected failures. Document intentional RFork transfer contracts.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
